(7004893, 1058697, 49109, '<td valign="top">I like that you didn''t try to make it a photorealistic scene like gyaban would do (most others regularly fail), but instead hid the seams with that gritty processing reminding of a cheap plastic camera. The pugs expression is perfect for this scene</td>', 'I like that you didn''t try to make it a photorealistic scene like gyaban would do (most others regularly fail), but instead hid the seams with that gritty processing reminding of a cheap plastic camera. The pugs expression is perfect for this scene', '2013-03-22 05:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
