(7005018, 1059496, 138253, '<td valign="top">Not voting, but i''d be giving this an 8 or a 9 if i were.<br/>This is definitely a ribbon contender based on what i''ve seen of the entries, hopefully it nets you the blue!<br/>Can''t wait to see this on the front page!</td>', 'Not voting, but i''d be giving this an 8 or a 9 if i were.This is definitely a ribbon contender based on what i''ve seen of the entries, hopefully it nets you the blue!Can''t wait to see this on the front page!', '2013-03-22 12:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005019, 1059518, 138253, '<td valign="top">one nitpicky thing here if you don''t mind: several people are more blurry than the objects behind them; i understand this is a realm of fantasy and this is stitched together from various images, but continuity will certainly help your score.</td>', 'one nitpicky thing here if you don''t mind: several people are more blurry than the objects behind them; i understand this is a realm of fantasy and this is stitched together from various images, but continuity will certainly help your score.', '2013-03-22 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005020, 1059613, 138253, '<td valign="top">great blending on the face to the banana.<br/>the arms have some hard edges but only a minor detraction.<br/>as someone pointed out recently, if you duplicate the item in another layer, apply a blur and set opacity to a low % value you can soften up your edges a bit more<br/>overall i see this finishing well in this given some of the other entries i''ve seen</td>', 'great blending on the face to the banana.the arms have some hard edges but only a minor detraction.as someone pointed out recently, if you duplicate the item in another layer, apply a blur and set opacity to a low % value you can soften up your edges a bit moreoverall i see this finishing well in this given some of the other entries i''ve seen', '2013-03-22 12:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005022, 1059551, 138253, '<td valign="top">This looks hot! I can see this catching everywhere! (lets see..what other fire jokes can i put in here....)<br/>The audience looks like it''s more of a simmering than a blazing crowd.<br/>That net is retardant! (hopefully)<br/>I''d make a "that team / he" is on fire joke but for all i know it could be a last-ditch, bottom of the (fire) barrel effort to get any points at all.<br/> <br/>The losing team is going down (down, down) in a burning ring of fire.<br/> <br/>ok...i think that about does it for the bad jokes.<br/>Overall i like this image, i''d say top 10 finish is a definite possibility. Good luck (and i hope you at least smiled at one of those jokes)! :)</td>', 'This looks hot! I can see this catching everywhere! (lets see..what other fire jokes can i put in here....)The audience looks like it''s more of a simmering than a blazing crowd.That net is retardant! (hopefully)I''d make a "that team / he" is on fire joke but for all i know it could be a last-ditch, bottom of the (fire) barrel effort to get any points at all. The losing team is going down (down, down) in a burning ring of fire. ok...i think that about does it for the bad jokes.Overall i like this image, i''d say top 10 finish is a definite possibility. Good luck (and i hope you at least smiled at one of those jokes)! :)', '2013-03-22 12:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005025, 1058654, 138253, '<td valign="top">I give him a 9 for height, a 7 for form, a 10 for enthusiasm and a prayer that he sticks (stuck) the landing!<br/>Great fun in this image and you did a good job isolating and repositioning him in the frame here.<br/>Lets hope for high marks from the other judges!</td>', 'I give him a 9 for height, a 7 for form, a 10 for enthusiasm and a prayer that he sticks (stuck) the landing!Great fun in this image and you did a good job isolating and repositioning him in the frame here.Lets hope for high marks from the other judges!', '2013-03-22 12:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
