(7005031, 1059591, 138253, '<td valign="top">this is one of my favorites from the challenge.<br/>the biggest problem is the legs look distorted - his right leg appears to be his left leg when you''re focused on the upper body, which in turn makes the left leg on bottom look like a mutant side-leg if you''re thought process says there''s no right leg.<br/>i''m not a hurdler myself, so this could well be proper form, but to me the bottom half looks to be rotated about 30-40 degrees from the body abnormally.<br/>post processing is spot on with the watery reflections, the fish are great and the bubbles off the find and hands add a nice touch of realism.<br/> <br/>i''m hoping that the 42 refers to "how many roads must a man walk down?" - and if you get the reference i hope it made you smile :)</td>', 'this is one of my favorites from the challenge.the biggest problem is the legs look distorted - his right leg appears to be his left leg when you''re focused on the upper body, which in turn makes the left leg on bottom look like a mutant side-leg if you''re thought process says there''s no right leg.i''m not a hurdler myself, so this could well be proper form, but to me the bottom half looks to be rotated about 30-40 degrees from the body abnormally.post processing is spot on with the watery reflections, the fish are great and the bubbles off the find and hands add a nice touch of realism. i''m hoping that the 42 refers to "how many roads must a man walk down?" - and if you get the reference i hope it made you smile :)', '2013-03-22 12:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
