(7005043, 1059281, 138253, '<td valign="top">i love the fantasy and originality in this. the kids look like they had a lot of fun shooting this, and i''m sure they love the finished product even more!<br/>the colors are vibrant and engaging, the sugar-land looks real enough to eat (and hopefully it was enjoyed after shooting!) and the light in all areas is equally applied (from the screen-right, with the left being darker).<br/>Fantastic job on this and I hope you are as satisfied with it as I am seeing it!</td>', 'i love the fantasy and originality in this. the kids look like they had a lot of fun shooting this, and i''m sure they love the finished product even more!the colors are vibrant and engaging, the sugar-land looks real enough to eat (and hopefully it was enjoyed after shooting!) and the light in all areas is equally applied (from the screen-right, with the left being darker).Fantastic job on this and I hope you are as satisfied with it as I am seeing it!', '2013-03-22 12:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7005045, 1059002, 138253, '<td valign="top">This made me shoot cola out of my nose on my lunch break which was about as unique an experience as seeing "killing seals" as the title of an image on DPC. Kudos sir, i salute you.<br/> <br/>I have to say that this isn''t as much a fantasy sport as many people would like it to be, and i am on the fence about that. I''m not sure if you''re trying to shed light on the topic, or just have a twisted sense of humor, but either way you''re getting a 7 from my cola-injected-nose.</td>', 'This made me shoot cola out of my nose on my lunch break which was about as unique an experience as seeing "killing seals" as the title of an image on DPC. Kudos sir, i salute you. I have to say that this isn''t as much a fantasy sport as many people would like it to be, and i am on the fence about that. I''m not sure if you''re trying to shed light on the topic, or just have a twisted sense of humor, but either way you''re getting a 7 from my cola-injected-nose.', '2013-03-22 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
