(7005071, 1059601, 138253, '<td valign="top">i''m at a bit of a loss here for what to say, but i''m trying to comment 100% with either thoughtful comments, what i think worked/didn''t for me, or something that i find witty. so here goes.<br/> <br/>"what jim failed to realize was that being told you can''t blindly train birds was a personal critique on his failure to see what was plainly in front of him; not that he required previous training in the field"<br/> <br/>i do enjoy the artistic concept of the image and find it quite pleasant to look at; for the challenge it''s a loose fit in my eyes, but that in no way alters it''s simplicity and beauty. i''m still giving this an 8.</td>', 'i''m at a bit of a loss here for what to say, but i''m trying to comment 100% with either thoughtful comments, what i think worked/didn''t for me, or something that i find witty. so here goes. "what jim failed to realize was that being told you can''t blindly train birds was a personal critique on his failure to see what was plainly in front of him; not that he required previous training in the field" i do enjoy the artistic concept of the image and find it quite pleasant to look at; for the challenge it''s a loose fit in my eyes, but that in no way alters it''s simplicity and beauty. i''m still giving this an 8.', '2013-03-22 13:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
