(7008752, 1059281, 138721, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for you great votes and comments. It was really funny to create this photo. My kids enjoyed a lot, not only during the posing, but mostly when they could eat all the sugar landscape ;-). Using Photoshop to create the final composition was a great challenge for me, as I''m just starting to learn how this amazing tool works. Regarding the title... yes, in Spanish "snail" is spelled "sneil"... I''ve been soooo may years talking and learning english and still make a lot of mistakes !!</td>', 'Thank you all for you great votes and comments. It was really funny to create this photo. My kids enjoyed a lot, not only during the posing, but mostly when they could eat all the sugar landscape ;-). Using Photoshop to create the final composition was a great challenge for me, as I''m just starting to learn how this amazing tool works. Regarding the title... yes, in Spanish "snail" is spelled "sneil"... I''ve been soooo may years talking and learning english and still make a lot of mistakes !!', '2013-03-29 02:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
